{"steamAppId":3103750,"description":"Synopsis.\nMany people have been invited to celebrate the Penguin Hotel's 18th anniversary. You are one of them.\nBut no one could have predicted it. No one expected it to turn out that way...\n\nFreeze Camera\nThis camera is a wonder. It can trap the subject inside the picture.\nUse this camera to solve mysteries and fight threats. Of course, you can also use it normally.\n\nBig Pen\nOne of the characters in this hotel. He is a robot, so he doesn't move at night...\n\nNot a fan of horror?\nWant to enjoy the world and the story!\nWe try to create games that both those who are good at horror games and those who are not good at horror games can enjoy.\n\nSeries\nThere is no ending branch.\nThis game is Chapter 1. Chapter 2 will be available in the future.\n\nAbout video production and distribution\nPlease include the name of this game in the distribution and video title.\nPlease put a link to SETAM in the summary section.\nOther than the above, we do not specify anything else. Please use common sense.\nWe want many people to know this game. So videos and distribution are welcome.","short_description":"You have been invited to the popular “Penguin Hotel”. There, you get caught up in a terrifying event. Solve puzzles and battle with a special camera! Experience a very strange penguin horror.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103750/header.jpg?t=1743589869","developer":"lemorion_1224","publisher":"lemorion_1224","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры, Казуальные игры, Инди, Бесплатные","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":2,"releaseLabel":"31 окт. 2024 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":88,"steamReviewCount":157,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103750/ss_e627df85c2710f1c087876fcd89831fd6ec60aaa.600x338.jpg?t=1743589869","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com